{"prompt": {"messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "You are a helpful assistant that translates Java code to Python 3 code. The code should reads and writes I/O from the console."}, {"role": "user", "content": "Translate the following Java 8 code to Python 3 code. The code reads and writes I/O from the console. Your translated code should have the exact same functionality as the given code, meaning that it should have the same output for any given input.\nPrint your translated code and also the confidence score you give to your translation. The confidence score should be a number between 0 and 1. The format of the output should be:\n<translated_code>\n<your_translated_code>\n</translated_code>\n<confidence>\n<your_confidence_score>\n</confidence>\nDo not provide any other text or markdown fences.\n\nHere is the original Java 8 code you have to translate:\n<original_code>\nimport java.io.*;\nimport java.util.*;\nimport java.util.stream.IntStream;\n\npublic class Main {\n    public static void main(String[] args) {\n        new Main().call();\n    }\n\n    private void call() {\n        Scanner sc = new Scanner(System.in);\n        PrintWriter pw = new PrintWriter(System.out);\n        int n = sc.nextInt();\n        if (n > 40) {\n            pw.println(0);\n            pw.close();\n            return;\n        }\n        Point[] pts = new Point[n];\n        for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) {\n            pts[i] = new Point(sc.nextLong(), sc.nextLong(), sc.nextLong(), sc.nextLong(), sc.nextLong());\n        }\n        if (n < 3) {\n            pw.println(n);\n            IntStream.rangeClosed(1, n).forEach(pw::println);\n            pw.close();\n            return;\n        }\n        List<Integer> list = new ArrayList<>();\n        for (int c = 0; c < n; c++) {\n            boolean flag = true;\n            for (int i = 0; i < n && flag; i++) {\n                if (i == c) continue;\n                for (int j = 0; j < n && flag; j++) {\n                    if (j == c || j == i) continue;\n                    Point a = pts[i].diff(pts[c]);\n                    Point b = pts[j].diff(pts[c]);\n                    if (a.inner(b) > 0) flag = false;\n                }\n            }\n            if (flag) list.add(c + 1);\n        }\n        pw.println(list.size());\n        list.forEach(pw::println);\n        pw.close();\n    }\n\n    static class Point {\n        long x1, x2, x3, x4, x5;\n\n        Point(long a, long b, long c, long d, long e) {\n            x1 = a; x2 = b; x3 = c; x4 = d; x5 = e;\n        }\n\n        Point diff(Point p) {\n            return new Point(x1 - p.x1, x2 - p.x2, x3 - p.x3, x4 - p.x4, x5 - p.x5);\n        }\n\n        long inner(Point p) {\n            return x1 * p.x1 + x2 * p.x2 + x3 * p.x3 + x4 * p.x4 + x5 * p.x5;\n        }\n    }\n}\n</original_code>\n"}], "temp": 0, "sample_size": 1, "logprobs": true, "model": "qwen/qwen3-coder-next"}, "response": {"samples": [{"content": "<translated_code>\nimport sys\nfrom functools import reduce\n\nclass Point:\n    def __init__(self, a, b, c, d, e):\n        self.x1 = a\n        self.x2 = b\n        self.x3 = c\n        self.x4 = d\n        self.x5 = e\n    \n    def diff(self, p):\n        return Point(self.x1 - p.x1, self.x2 - p.x2, self.x3 - p.x3, self.x4 - p.x4, self.x5 - p.x5)\n    \n    def inner(self, p):\n        return self.x1 * p.x1 + self.x2 * p.x2 + self.x3 * p.x3 + self.x4 * p.x4 + self.x5 * p.x5\n\ndef main():\n    input = sys.stdin.read\n    data = input().split()\n    idx = 0\n    \n    n = int(data[idx])\n    idx += 1\n    \n    if n > 40:\n        print(0)\n        return\n    \n    pts = []\n    for i in range(n):\n        coords = [int(data[idx + j]) for j in range(5)]\n        idx += 5\n        pts.append(Point(*coords))\n    \n    if n < 3:\n        print(n)\n        for i in range(1, n + 1):\n            print(i)\n        return\n    \n    result_list = []\n    for c in range(n):\n        flag = True\n        for i in range(n):\n            if not flag:\n                break\n            if i == c:\n                continue\n            for j in range(n):\n                if j == c or j == i:\n                    continue\n                a = pts[i].diff(pts[c])\n                b = pts[j].diff(pts[c])\n                if a.inner(b) > 0:\n                    flag = False\n                    break\n        if flag:\n            result_list.append(c + 1)\n    \n    print(len(result_list))\n    for val in result_list:\n        print(val)\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    main()\n</translated_code>\n<confidence>\n0.95\n</confidence>", "token_logprobs": [-7.56950321374461e-05, -1.311301275563892e-06, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -0.00035661060246638954, -0.006897449027746916, -0.126931831240654, -0.014203056693077087, -1.0505356788635254, -7.152555099310121e-07, -0.05837849900126457, -0.0068732975050807, -0.47409048676490784, -0.0015356664080172777, -9.536738616588991e-07, -8.344646857949556e-07, -0.0009120118920691311, -5.245195097813848e-06, -7.152555099310121e-07, -3.576278118089249e-07, -1.1920922133867862e-06, 0.0, -0.001510551548562944, -4.0531076592742465e-06, -2.3841855067985307e-07, 0.0, -9.536738616588991e-07, 0.0, -1.1920922133867862e-06, 0.0, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -4.291525328881107e-06, -1.6689286894688848e-06, -1.1920922133867862e-06, 0.0, 0.0, -0.00020346954988781363, -2.3841855067985307e-07, -1.311301275563892e-06, 0.0, 0.0, -2.3841855067985307e-07, -3.576278118089249e-07, 0.0, -1.6689286894688848e-06, -9.179073458653875e-06, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -5.960462772236497e-07, 0.0, -2.3841855067985307e-07, -1.9073468138230965e-06, -5.1020273531321436e-05, -2.3841855067985307e-07, -3.576278118089249e-07, -1.9073468138230965e-06, -9.536738616588991e-07, -4.0531076592742465e-06, -2.3841855067985307e-07, -3.0517112463712692e-05, 0.0, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -2.7418097943154862e-06, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -1.5497195136049413e-06, -1.7881377516459906e-06, -1.7881377516459906e-06, -0.504606